
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mara's Laboratory</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@600;700;800&family=Rajdhani:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
  background: #850d18;
  color: white;
}

.lab {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 35px 6%;
  overflow: hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, #ff4242 0%, transparent 30%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 85%, #a80d21 0%, transparent 35%),
    linear-gradient(135deg, #590b15, #bd1828 55%, #ed292c);
  position: relative;
}

/* TECH GRID */

.lab::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(#ffffff0b 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff0b 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 35px 35px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.content {
  position: relative;
  max-width: 1150px;
  margin: auto;
}

/* TOP LABEL */

.top-label {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff40;
  padding-bottom: 15px;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.logo {
  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: #fff;
}

.status {
  color: #75f4ff;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

/* SECTION 1 */

.welcome {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 35px;
  padding: 30px 0 65px;
}

.small-title {
  color: #72f5ff;
  font-size: 13px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h1 {
  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 55px);
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: #ffdf72;
  text-shadow: 3px 4px #75101a;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.welcome-text {
  background: #102a47;
  border: 1px solid #65dfff;
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 22px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00d9ff35;
}

.welcome-text p {
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.mara-area {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 280px;
  position: relative;
}

.mara-frame {
  width: min(270px, 85%);
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  border: 3px solid #76eaff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #173b62, #081a30);
  box-shadow: 0 0 35px #00d9ff70;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.mara-frame img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.character-caption {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 5px;
  background: #102a47;
  border: 1px solid #71edff;
  padding: 10px 25px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  color: #ffdf72;
  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

/* SECTION 2 */

.shapes-section {
  background: #0b2038;
  border: 1px solid #55dfff;
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: 30px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #0005;
}

.section-heading {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.section-heading h2 {
  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
  color: #ffdc70;
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
}

.section-heading p {
  color: #a8eaff;
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-top: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.shape-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 17px;
}

.shape-card {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #173b60, #0a192d);
  border: 1px solid #48cafa;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 23px 12px;
  text-align: center;
  transition: .3s;
}

.shape-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-9px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px #26dfff70;
  border-color: #ffe16e;
}

.shape-visual {
  height: 110px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

/* SHAPE DRAWINGS */

.square {
  width: 65px;
  height: 65px;
  background: #32c9ff;
  border: 3px solid white;
  box-shadow: 0 0 18px #20cfff;
}

.rectangle {
  width: 95px;
  height: 60px;
  background: #ffca51;
  border: 3px solid white;
  box-shadow: 0 0 18px #ffca51;
}

.triangle {
  width: 0;
  height: 0;
  border-left: 40px solid transparent;
  border-right: 40px solid transparent;
  border-bottom: 75px solid #71e6a7;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px #71e6a7);
}

.circle {
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
  background: #ed8bff;
  border: 3px solid white;
  border-radius: 50%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 18px #ed8bff;
}

.shape-card h3 {
  color: #ffdd70;
  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.shape-card p {
  color: #d9eaff;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.investigation {
  margin-top: 25px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #173b60, #174b66);
  border-left: 5px solid #70edff;
  padding: 18px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.investigation h3 {
  color: #ffdc70;
  font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.investigation p {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* FOOTER */

.footer {
  text-align: center;
  color: #a8eaff;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}

@media(max-width: 700px) {
  .welcome {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .welcome-text {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .mara-area {
    order: -1;
    min-height: 240px;
  }

  .mara-frame {
    width: 210px;
  }

  .shape-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  .top-label {
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .shapes-section {
    padding: 20px 12px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="lab">
<div class="content">

  <div class="top-label">
    <div class="logo">✦ MECHA ACADEMY</div>
    <div class="status">● YEAR 2 // MISSION ACTIVE</div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 1: WELCOME -->

  <section class="welcome">

    <div>
      <div class="small-title">
        MECHA-MISI GEOMETRI // MARA'S LABORATORY
      </div>

      <h1>WELCOME TO<br>MARA'S LABORATORY!</h1>

      <div class="welcome-text">
        <p>
          Hi, Math Heroes! I'm Mara. Today, we are
          going to discover the 2D shapes that form
          our 3D objects. Are you ready to investigate?
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mara-area">

      <!-- Replace image URL with Mara PNG URL -->
      <div class="mara-frame">
        <img
          src="PASTE_MARA_PNG_URL_HERE"
          alt="Mara from Mechamato"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="character-caption">
        YOUR LAB GUIDE: MARA
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2: MEET THE 2D SHAPES -->

  <section class="shapes-section">

    <div class="section-heading">
      <div class="small-title">LABORATORY DATABASE // 01</div>

      <h2>MEET THE 2D SHAPES</h2>

      <p>
        Before we explore 3D objects, let's get to
        know the basic 2D shapes!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="shape-grid">

      <div class="shape-card">
        <div class="shape-visual">
          <div class="square"></div>
        </div>
        <h3>SQUARE</h3>
        <p>4 equal sides and 4 corners.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="shape-card">
        <div class="shape-visual">
          <div class="rectangle"></div>
        </div>
        <h3>RECTANGLE</h3>
        <p>4 sides and 4 right angles.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="shape-card">
        <div class="shape-visual">
          <div class="triangle"></div>
        </div>
        <h3>TRIANGLE</h3>
        <p>3 sides and 3 corners.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="shape-card">
        <div class="shape-visual">
          <div class="circle"></div>
        </div>
        <h3>CIRCLE</h3>
        <p>A round shape with no corners.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="investigation">
      <h3>✦ MARA'S TIP</h3>
      <p>
        Look carefully at each shape! These 2D shapes
        will help us understand the faces and surfaces
        of different 3D objects.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <div class="footer">
    MECHA-MISI GEOMETRI • EXPLORE • DISCOVER • LEARN
  </div>

</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
